WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:07.600
The three armies stood ready at their posts. War drums thundered like tempests, and the warriors of Great Xuan pledged to fight to the death.

00:07.680 --> 00:09.920
Who rebelled? How can a dead man rebel?

00:10.080 --> 00:14.280
The news is true previous letters seem to have been written by someone imitating General Chen.

00:14.360 --> 00:19.027
I'm afraid General Chen was already beheaded and his head used as a banner.

00:20.920 --> 00:22.320
Chancellor Chen.

00:24.880 --> 00:26.280
Ying'er.

00:34.480 --> 00:39.080
Immediately order Qingzhou Army to advance at full speed destroy the rebels.

00:39.640 --> 00:41.240
Avenge my son.

00:41.520 --> 00:42.920
Yes.

00:45.560 --> 00:46.960
Ying'er.

00:49.000 --> 00:51.920
Ying'er.

00:56.000 --> 01:05.500
Beacon fires stretched across the horizons. Both hosts clashed in fierce combat day and night, corpses littering the plains with neither side giving ground.

01:06.920 --> 01:11.520
What we need now is time must, before Qingzhou Army's main force catches up to us.

01:11.640 --> 01:13.640
Take the capital in one strike.

01:15.080 --> 01:17.747
Need someone to block Qingzhou Army for us.

01:19.360 --> 01:21.027
Any news from Beiyu Pass?

01:21.720 --> 01:23.160
General Zu Yue said.

01:23.480 --> 01:27.840
I don't care how the Sikong family stirs things up this Beiyu Pass.

01:28.480 --> 01:34.000
Always needs someone to guard it I won't let my father's lifetime of honor be erased.

01:37.160 --> 01:42.560
You crossing Tianhe I can pretend not to see if the court questions.

01:43.480 --> 01:48.160
I will return to the capital to ask for punishment this is already the best news.

01:48.720 --> 01:53.600
If it really comes to it leave me three hundred warriors I'll cover the rear.

01:54.040 --> 01:55.440
Report.

01:56.960 --> 02:00.987
A Wuzhao person seeks an audience outside camp says he can solve Your Highness's current predicament.

02:02.160 --> 02:03.560
A Wuzhao person.

